              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenchï Aitopel Apsolom, “Wïyö rïwö nko chemïnïngweniko* papongu chay kedong kïrip kata atökunkïtï Israel kïmïkul lö kelïkunyi punyon ompö papongu. Atökïnyorï owesyö pich cho imitenyi tïkwïl.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
